{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1453.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"a1a084ee7617789cc22158e045a2a0e2a9d1ce6f9b6e8f59f75f57c559632312","ja":"イメージアイス","zh":"印象冰淇淋","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1453.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"74832115e6b6e7cca737a45187199688d498cbb3a5609eb0aadc0594ac9c2b71","ja":"たしかに、チョコミントって、\n藍さんっぽいかも～！","zh":"确实，薄荷巧克力，\n感觉挺符合蓝女士的～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1453.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"18e56292aebfc1b92539acd129f9815d8115a62acb06653b704b6d52e2c238f5","ja":"でも私のイメージだと、\nおとなっぽさもほしいかも。","zh":"不过按我的设想，\n可能也需要一些成熟感。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1453.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"345bd80420112c904ac9f8c236f59293375e095750382b4562673111107a2060","ja":"だったら、抹茶アイスを添えてみても\nいいんじゃないかな？","zh":"既然这样，再加上抹茶冰淇淋\n试一下怎么样？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1453.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"5687d6f355136e3c17feceab689181f7be0e79d7f5c3b6f8a5813c5a5b4b5050","ja":"ほろ苦くて甘さを引き締めてくれるところなんて、\nピッタリだと思うよ。","zh":"那种带点微苦、能让甜味更加醇厚收敛的感觉，\n我觉得正合适哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1453.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"491e63c9f145c99d1c0fc94dfcd588d7fc73ebd52d8f2acfdd46e29e3a551584","ja":"湊のイメージは……よくわかんないから、琴葉でいい？\nやっぱストロベリーかな～、よく食べてるし。","zh":"凑的印象是……我不太清楚，琴叶你来定行吗？\n果然还是草莓吧～她也经常吃。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1453.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"79956a04cf13cec4f5f703d1133bbb6fc5d653998e8837f16daaa2456577211d","ja":"コトハは、バニラも似合うと思うナ～。\nビターなチョコも、合ってるかも？","zh":"我觉得琴叶也很适合香草呢～。\n微苦的巧克力，说不定也挺合适？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1453.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"0639d11a58630d8087a1c697296d3ce988ba005ffb609b310144848374794ccd","ja":"トッピングもこだわりたいよね～。\n冷えた口の中を温かくするウェハースとか。","zh":"配料也想讲究一下呢～。\n比如能让冰凉的嘴里暖和起来的威化饼之类的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1453.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"d1b315df7663d862e4169e24930c0f1e862733f63ebd2d3ac2d95bc310d584d5","ja":"そ、そこまで色々入れちゃうと、\nちょっと多すぎるんじゃないかな……。","zh":"放、放进去那么多的话，\n会不会有点太多了啊……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1453.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"71439239039af69e028565d740fea7c0c3ceb3ef6168e7a1b56dc16e6b7998a7","ja":"でも、誰かをイメージしたアイスを\n考えるのって面白いね。みんなのもやってみよう！","zh":"不过，构思以某个人为灵感的冰淇淋\n还挺有意思的呢。也来做做大家的吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1453.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"baed4bbfbe72aba414363fb0a7ca589cb854dc077f14d41b8a94c7cae3114f4c","ja":"じゃあ、次は私のアイスを考えてくださーい！\nどんなアイスができるかな～♪　美味しいかな～♪","zh":"那么，接下来请帮我构思冰淇淋吧～！\n会做出什么样的冰淇淋呢～♪ 好不好吃呢～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1453.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"6d15d991910f55beef884649ecdc0040926dde31ba718f89c8d29b53605ab076","ja":"その次は、私の分も考えてほしいな♪","zh":"下次也希望能替我考虑一下呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1453.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"657aa0d57c7f81ce357d6997886ff491376fc9ca197498d18b372cc7490481e0","ja":"ワタシとメグミの分もネ！\nそしたら、ここにいるメンバーをコンプリートだヨ♪","zh":"我和惠美的也要哦！\n这样一来，在场的成员就集齐啦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1453.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"a83b627821b710c1ca33710ea658cd0aaee6656907dce2a635410a42987b9222","ja":"そうだ！　5人分ぜーんぶ合わせて、\nユニットアイスにしちゃう、なんてどうかな？","zh":"对了！把5人份的全～部合在一起，\n做成组合冰淇淋，你觉得怎么样？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1453.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"f3c220a9dea6816a88cd3ca18b803a5ab6703b6f71888938e069df01dc15524c","ja":"それ、名案だね！　もしかしたら、すっごく\n美味しいアイスのセットができちゃうかも！","zh":"这是个好主意呢！说不定真能做出\n超级美味的冰淇淋套餐呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1453.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"ab45d5590b753fe61399ad34d952a2c57585db551885cd6a8d25e5b60b266f76","ja":"よーし！　さっそくみんなで作ってみましょう♪","zh":"好——！这就和大家一起做做看吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
